# Cloudflare Pages response headers for every route on 6502.dbhq.uk.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# These apply AT THE EDGE ONLY. `astro preview` will not send them, so verify
# with `curl -I` against the deployed host, never against a local server.
#
# THE CSP ALLOWS EXACTLY ONE THIRD-PARTY ORIGIN, and it is Google Analytics.
# Everything else is 'self': no font host, no embed, no inline script.
# script-src has no 'unsafe-inline', which is why analytics.js and consent.js
# are same-origin files rather than Google's inline snippet.
#
# GA IS CONSENT-GATED AND NOTHING LOADS UNTIL A VISITOR ACCEPTS. The origins
# below are permission to load, not a decision to. GA4 sets its cookie on the
# shared .dbhq.uk parent, so a cookie dropped here without consent is a cookie
# across the whole estate.
#
# Two other relaxations, both narrow. style-src needs 'unsafe-inline' because
# Astro inlines every stylesheet (build.inlineStylesheets: 'always'), which keeps
# the first paint unblocked. img-src allows data: URIs for small inlined images,
# which cannot run script.
#
# Adding any further origin means asking what it sets and whether the consent
# prompt covers it.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com; manifest-src 'self'; frame-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
